Subject: [PATCH] feat: add a real Security and quality tab in the Qt client

Ports the Security & quality tab from newnewnode: RepoSecurity scan engine
(RepoSecurity.{h,cpp}) plus buildRepoSecurityTab()/refreshRepoSecurity() wired
into the existing 'Security and quality' tab slot (replacing the placeholder).

Extracted cleanly from nnn commit 4321319 (repository workflow hardening),
deliberately excluding that commit's unrelated changes (the PR 'Fix with agent'
button that would have removed forkmesh's Edit-file feature, and AgentSession
fields forkmesh does not have).
